<title>USA: Caterpillar to issue 100-yr bond -sources.</title>
<headline>Caterpillar to issue 100-yr bond -sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caterpillar Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a 100-year bond, syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The size of the issue is expected to be between $300 and $400 million and will be callable after 50 years, sources added.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co is expected to serve as lead manager on the debt offering.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
